      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CHARMING THREE BEDROOM COTTAGE TO RENT IN THE COUNTRYSIDE OUTSIDE GOWNA, CO.CAVAN\n\nSmith Property are delighted to bring to the rental market this lovely three-bedroom cottage which offers a wonderful opportunity to enjoy a quieter rural lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of local towns and amenities.\nThe property has a warm and welcoming feel, with a cosy living room featuring a multi -fuel stove .\nThe accommodation comprises a living room, kitchen, utility room, sitting room, three bedrooms and a bathroom.\n\nThe property is conveniently located approximately 2 5 km from Gowna village, 10 15 km from Ballinagh, 10 20 km from Arva/Arvagh, 15 20 km from Killeshandra, and 20 25 km from Cavan Town, offering easy access to local amenities,\n\nGowna Village is close by offering services and amenities, including shops. post office and the well known Pikers Lodge Hotel.\n\nPlease note: The cottage is situated beside a working farm, so prospective tenants should be aware that there may be some activity associated with a working agricultural environment. Due to the location and surrounding farm operations, the property is not suitable for pets/animals.\n\nTo Apply\n\n.\nInterested applicants are asked to visit the Smith Property website and complete the Tenancy Application Form, located in the Rental/Tenants section.\n\n\nPlease note that references are required before viewing. \nApplicants should have their current landlord reference available for submission with the application.\n"
